  - FIX: Replace string-valued RepetitionTime and EchoTime in 95 T1w sidecars
    with numeric values from ABIDE II scan parameter documents (BNI_1: TR=0.0067,
    TE=0.0031; ETHZ_1: TR=0.0084, TE=0.0039).
  - FIX: Rename misspelled metadata keys in 2,575 JSON sidecars
    (MagneicFieldStrength, MagneicFieldSrengh -> MagneticFieldStrength;
    PlaneOrientationSequentialuence -> PlaneOrientationSequence;
    PulseSequentialuenceType -> PulseSequenceType).
  - ADD: 360 DWI JSON sidecars for 6 ABIDE II sites (BNI_1, IP_1, NYU_1,
    NYU_2, SDSU_1, TCD_1) from upstream templates and NITRC scan parameter
    documents.
  - ADD: README.md with dataset overview, subject ID scheme, and BIDS audit log.

